Z||000000||FLASHY||10-06-2001||01:37 AM||||Just to keep the records straight, this is NOT a fiero kit but would be awesome if it was. I came across this on the internet and couldn't believe the resemblance it had to the Fiero (well to me it does). <P>Apparently this is a prototype car called the (get this) Fioravanti. So not only does it have a similar look but also a similar name. Anyway, I freaked out when I saw this and had to share it with everyone.<P>If anybody ever made this car into a kit for the Fiero I'd buy it in a second!<P>This angle looks the most like a Fiero to me.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fioravanti_f100.jpg"> <P><BR>Another view<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fioravanti_f1003.jpg"> <P><BR>More views<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fioravanti_f1002.jpg"> <P><BR>And even a convertible!<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fioravanti_f1001.jpg"> <P><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/spinsig3.gif"> ||||reg||14
