Z||000010||ds21||10-06-2001||11:34 AM||||Looks Cool!<P>Another car I've always been in love with is the Vector. Although I now think the W8 looks dated, well it did come out in the 70's! Back in about 92 I went to the winter CES show in Vegas and low and behold they had a Vector WX3 on display now that would be the perfect car for a Fiero Kit, similar to a Diablo but originally an American car! <P>Just think of it The only other American Mid-engine Sports car as a kit for an American Mid-engine Sports car!<P>Now That Would Be Cool!!!||||reg||12
